.TH YT-DLP-ARIA2-DOWNLOADER-GUI 1 "" "yt-dlp aria2 downloader" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
yt-dlp-aria2-downloader-gui \- Zenity interface for yt-dlp aria2 downloader
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B yt-dlp-aria2-downloader-gui
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B yt-dlp-aria2-downloader-gui
starts the Zenity graphical interface. It lets the user select a download
profile and destination, then supervises a single
.BR yt-dlp-aria2-downloader (1)
session with progress reporting and cancellation.
.PP
The graphical interface supports complete MKV video, authenticated YouTube HLS
video using Firefox cookies, and native-format audio profiles.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/yt-dlp-aria2-downloader/gui.conf
Default GUI configuration file when
.B XDG_CONFIG_HOME
is not set.
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/yt-dlp-aria2-downloader/
Default retained GUI state and diagnostic-log location when
.B XDG_STATE_HOME
is not set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR yt-dlp-aria2-downloader (1),
.BR zenity (1)
.SH HOMEPAGE
https://github.com/OscarFrog/yt-dlp-aria2-downloader-gui
